---
description: PurgeSwipe iOS project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before changing code. Non-negotiables:

- Keep onboarding, settings, help/FAQ, about, and in-app privacy/terms links.
- Restorable purchases need Restore Purchases on the paywall and in Settings.
- Account creation requires in-app account deletion.
- Request permissions at the moment of use; no launch-time prompts.
- Dynamic Type, VoiceOver labels, 44×44 pt targets, light/dark contrast, Reduce Motion.
- All user-facing copy in `Localizable.xcstrings` (vi + en); permission strings in `InfoPlist.xcstrings`.
- `project.yml` is the source of truth; run `xcodegen generate` after editing it.
- Build/test with `PurgeSwipe-Dev`; heavy work runs on GitHub Actions.
